JUST IN: 🇺🇸🇮🇷US removes select Iran-related sanctions.

The US Treasury removed Iraqi airline Fly Baghdad and two aircraft linked to Iran's IRGC from its SDN list. The overall US sanctions program against Iran remains in effect.
